{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This demo includes</strong> just one level, but even here you\u2019ll encounter the Bear, Flying Fish, and the Fox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re super skilled, you can beat it in 5 minutes, but most players take around 20\u201330 minutes to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This level isn\u2019t the start of the game\u2019s main story, so you\u2019re free to stream and record videos\u2014when the full version is released, the beginning will be completely different.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Before you play, take a deep breath and be patient - you can do it!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you can roll and jump - and that\u2019s it. With practice, you\u2019ll be able to overcome any obstacle without pain or suffering. At this stage, go ahead and tell your friends about the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813920/extras/3f03b753fd9ce4dbb99d5d9c1dec7d20.poster.avif?t=1756393028\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813920/extras/3f03b753fd9ce4dbb99d5d9c1dec7d20.webm?t=1756393028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813920/extras/3f03b753fd9ce4dbb99d5d9c1dec7d20.mp4?t=1756393028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fox Traps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813920/extras/844591c0407fe20bcd7a5db4768c32d9.poster.avif?t=1756393028\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813920/extras/844591c0407fe20bcd7a5db4768c32d9.webm?t=1756393028\" ty